  {
   "text": "Ask AI to multiply two eight-digit numbers, and the first four digits come out right.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 5.48
  },
  {
   "text": "Everything after that was wrong.",
   "start": 6.32,
   "end": 7.46
  },
  {
   "text": "Sixteen digits, the right length, and still wrong.",
   "start": 7.46,
   "end": 11.46
  },
  {
   "text": "We gave Gemini Flash-Lite ten problems at every size, from two digits to ten.",
   "start": 12.22,
   "end": 17.46
  },
  {
   "text": "Code checked every digit.",
   "start": 17.98,
   "end": 19.16
  },
  {
   "text": "At two digits it was perfect, and from six digits up it got none right.",
   "start": 19.76,
   "end": 24.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Then we asked it to show its working, and it got twenty-one of twenty-five right.",
   "start": 24.2,
   "end": 29.32
  },
  {
   "text": "So make AI show its working, or check its sums with code.",
   "start": 30.08,
   "end": 33.48
  },
  {
   "text": "Would you have checked?",
